{% if section.blocks.size > 0 or request.design_mode %}
  <section id="reviews" class="section section--sand review-app">
    <div class="section-title"><span class="eyebrow">FROM PET PARENTS</span><h2>Real stories, shared with care.</h2><p>Verified feedback from customers who share life with their pets.</p></div>
    {% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
      {% for block in section.blocks %}{% render block %}{% endfor %}
    {% elsif request.design_mode %}
      <div class="sample-notice">SAMPLE PREVIEW — replace with verified customer reviews before publishing.</div>
      <div class="review-grid">
        <article class="review-card"><img src="{{ 'krozo-lifestyle-banner.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Sample customer review layout" width="120" height="120"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The layout makes customer feedback feel personal, calm and trustworthy.”</p><strong>Sample customer</strong><small>Preview only · Verified Purchase placement</small></article>
        <article class="review-card"><img src="{{ 'krozo-hero-lifestyle.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Sample customer review layout" width="120" height="120"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“This card is ready for a genuine review collected through your review app.”</p><strong>Sample customer</strong><small>Preview only · United States</small></article>
        <article class="review-card"><img src="{{ 'krozo-gallery-cat.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Sample customer review layout" width="120" height="120"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Customer photos, country and verification will appear here once available.”</p><strong>Sample customer</strong><small>Preview only · United Kingdom</small></article>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
{% endif %}
{% schema %}{"name":"Verified reviews","blocks":[{"type":"@app"}],"presets":[{"name":"Verified reviews"}]}{% endschema %}
